{"title":"2023 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(a_bit_faster)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (a bit faster)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(answer_choices)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (answer choices)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Solution_5_(Bash)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5 (Bash)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Solution_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Solution_7\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 7</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/d/98d9501b5431aad136fe4d35c709dc3930eb0858.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2^3 - 1^3 + 4^3 - 3^3 + 6^3 - 5^3 + \\dots + 18^3 - 17^3?\\]\" width=\"357\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/f/bbf008a69f1a36792c2996d41c8525c3d5dc57a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 2023 \\qquad\\textbf{(B) } 2679 \\qquad\\textbf{(C) } 2941 \\qquad\\textbf{(D) } 3159 \\qquad\\textbf{(E) } 3235$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"492\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To solve this problem, we will be using difference of cube, sum of squares and sum of arithmetic sequence formulas.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/f/47fc7a2879891789b01a2c24c374da9f37a6f0a1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2^3-1^3+4^3-3^3+6^3-5^3+...+18^3-17^3\\]\" width=\"341\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/8/13839686e5fa21b4456e312c5ef858cfd46c667a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=(2-1)(2^2+1 \\cdot 2+1^2)+(4-3)(4^2+4 \\cdot 3+3^2)+(6-5)(6^2+6 \\cdot 5+5^2)+...+(18-17)(18^2+18 \\cdot 17+17^2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"890\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/2/dc23aba4c6e1a59fa8e5bca880641705c9817dd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=(2^2+1 \\cdot 2+1^2)+(4^2+4 \\cdot 3+3^2)+(6^2+6 \\cdot 5+5^2)+...+(18^2+18 \\cdot 17+17^2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"653\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/c/67cb2e6098b981346727a00214b6a7b57ae917fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=1^2+2^2+3^2+4^2+5^2+6^2...+17^2+18^2+1 \\cdot 2+3 \\cdot 4+5 \\cdot 6+...+17 \\cdot 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"612\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/1/b11ac92b26937fdf3ce73cdff96163f50f693887.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{18(18+1)(36+1)}{6}+1 \\cdot 2+3 \\cdot 4+5 \\cdot 6+...+17 \\cdot 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"440\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>we could rewrite the second part as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/2/9b2077e2f42894b25a6d65237bfa181452f49a08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{n=1}^{9}(2n-1)(2n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"127\" height=\"55\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/f/81feee935ec1a7ee8025a3eaef2de1a6c1be997c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2n-1)(2n)=4n^2-2n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"195\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/1/c21ff428fa428c45a34296a0303fdd3fd9e2a1a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{n=1}^{9}4n^2=4(\\frac{9(9+1)(18+1)}{6})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"237\" height=\"55\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/6/106bb2acf6a0088d803622342a39233f54e628c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{n=1}^{9}-2n=-2(\\frac{9(9+1)}{2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"194\" height=\"55\" />\n</p><p>Hence,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/b/b1b39e27ff6a613d6d270e93f91822d3983eb5eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\cdot 2+3 \\cdot 4+5 \\cdot 6+...+17 \\cdot 18 = 4(\\frac{9(9+1)(18+1)}{6})-2(\\frac{9(9+1)}{2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"541\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>Adding everything up:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/3/e536239371d82bd8525c373bcf8c1c39d49ed349.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^3-1^3+4^3-3^3+6^3-5^3+...+18^3-17^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"345\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/8/f28bdcad880801707bd1c0badb3a40c36275b22d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{18(18+1)(36+1)}{6}+4(\\frac{9(9+1)(18+1)}{6})-2(\\frac{9(9+1)}{2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"460\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/a/80abc0b25300fbf0c70b0d541c94ed1d8221f1e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=3(19)(37)+6(10)(19)-9(10)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"254\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/3/663ad79fba5132dc721cee66a0f181150a3b9c63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=2109+1140-90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"156\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/0/320634ef32f61f8f56e3deed925208759f5bbcdf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) } 3159}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"105\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~lptoggled\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Think about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/1/12144c385990eab006960fe1dea20cc4f6fcf76a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^3+4^3+6^3+...+18^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"181\" height=\"18\" />. Once we factor out <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/4/57421b8557f6aa4384653806bfc7a5b80faf557a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^3=8$\" width=\"49\" height=\"15\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/3/ca3758039c4bdf710489737032b2c93f7fe4df7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1^3+2^3+...+9^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"133\" height=\"18\" />, which can be found using the sum of cubes formula, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/9/c89589e3fdea65a7e87e840eb6de9b5f63ce91a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\frac{n(n+1)}{2})^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"95\" height=\"40\" />. Now think about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/8/a68d6e7468dae6a7e8389c17d7e0cca42be7c805.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1^3+3^3+...+17^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"142\" height=\"18\" />. This is just the previous sum subtracted from the total sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/7/5e7a1b6098a8c98b8e4adae526aeef4b91712620.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> cubes. So now we have the two things we need to add. The sum of all the even cubes is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/c/d7c436f300651b702efa3885272ed626554d449c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8\\cdot (\\frac{90}{2})^2\\rightarrow 8\\cdot 2025 = 16200$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"224\" height=\"38\" />. The sum of all cubes from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/d/56dd47945e92f8205a63aae2eeca65af834868c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" /> to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/2/a62cd21f20ad2b4f7e2f5e8660f355f23397bf36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$18^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"27\" height=\"17\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/c/49c5553918d8240fc215cb24188c43ad9a5c7fb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\frac{18\\cdot 19}{2})^2=29241$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"147\" height=\"38\" />. The sum of the odd cubes is then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/f/eefd2bdc450ec7b1545033c73adb6f5ab188eb0b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$29241-16200=13041$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"185\" height=\"15\" />. Thus we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/2/7922fda635bda087071cf684febcaacb85f26c08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16200-13041=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) } 3159}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"223\" height=\"30\" />\n~amcrunner\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28a_bit_faster.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(a_bit_faster)\">Solution 2 (a bit faster)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (a bit faster)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Using the same sum of cubes formula, we can rewrite as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/0/0f0a60ca07487131dcffb2cfc7ef626c6fe5c5e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(2^3 + 4^3 + ... + 18^3) - (1^3 + 2^3 + ... + 18^3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"342\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/e/7ae11f2cc3b6bffbc5db6a6f8dcfbf2aecf1b15a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= 2(2^3)(1^3 + ... + 9^3) - (1^3 + ... + 18^3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"306\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/a/9ba2a258b0e007d782665e721637c014e2263a13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= 16(5 \\cdot 9)^2 - (9 \\cdot 19)^2 = 9^2(20^2 - 19^2) = 81 \\cdot 39 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D) } 3159}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"486\" height=\"30\" />\n~AoPSuser216\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For any real numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/d/6fdabd65ae5a22199957973107b77ac48d585b3f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3-y^3=(x-y)(x^2+xy+y^2)=(x-y)((x-y)^2+3xy)=(x-y)^3+3xy(x-y)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"658\" height=\"21\" />. \n</p><p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/a/06a7fafb72bdeb1dea952e86f92b05d9b5272923.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = y + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" />, with the above formula, we will get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/0/9509b00faf22fdeb11e6a016bb7963e1923ed7c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3-y^3=1^3+3xy=1 + 3xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"236\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/2/2c2005c1cff13aacf0edc24d0801a2a4f717466f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^3 - 1^3 + 4^3 - 3^3 + \\dots + 18^3 - 17^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"274\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/5/cc54eb19b13d216f7debdde34ee364dbdba4eb5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= (1 + 3\\cdot 1\\cdot 2) + (1 + 3\\cdot 3\\cdot 4) + \\dots + (1 + 3\\cdot 17\\cdot 18)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"424\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/e/10e5aef154d5a3b7f2d14b6eb1a5f12e141649fe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= 9 + 3\\cdot (1\\cdot 2 + 3\\cdot 4 + \\dots + 17\\cdot 18)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"289\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/4/ea4ae8d9893db2b46fa1e59e38af85ff71805c5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= 9 + 3 \\cdot (2 + 12 + 30 + 56 + 90 + 132 + 182 + 240 + 306)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"457\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/a/3ca49a4c8e6cf7e2be10347de61b79d8a359be28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= 9 + 3 \\cdot 1050$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"111\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/8/9b89613869bbdd8a856d7ebafd0ff7cd261ad7ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= \\boxed{\\textbf{(D) } 3159}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"105\" height=\"30\" />\n</p><p>~sqroot\n</p><p>Alternatively, to avoid the long sum, \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/1/541a50a505ee76260d6c1c6cfc6441a52ec970b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1\\cdot 2 + 3\\cdot 4 + \\dots + 17\\cdot 18) \\\\  = (2^2)(9(10)(19)/6) - (2)(9(10)/2) \\\\ =(2)(9)(10)(2(19/6) - 1/2) \\\\ = 180(35/6) = 35(30) = 1050$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"80\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We rewrite the sum as \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/1/2017f98837dd1a616e5b083dc3aeff04990fdb8f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{k=1}^{9}(2k)^3-(2k-1)^3\\]\" width=\"158\" height=\"51\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/7/b1742b29a645c1157ea831e135a30599da4ddb73.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[=\\sum_{k=1}^{9} 12k^2 - 6k + 1\\]\" width=\"154\" height=\"51\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/a/43a20abf0f70026ed4b4ac914d57aac9f0632125.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[=12\\sum_{k=1}^{9}k^2 - 6\\sum_{k=1}^{9}k + 9\\]\" width=\"189\" height=\"51\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/d/18d3256bb29b744d6d1ad8465140412d176c0c6e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[=12\\cdot\\frac{9\\cdot 10\\cdot 19}{6} -6\\cdot \\frac{9\\cdot 10}{2} + 9\\]\" width=\"244\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/7/ad766ce40a0ef8cc6dc5569a11ac2cd68f29461c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[=3420 - 270 + 9 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D) } 3159}\\]\" width=\"243\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>-Benedict T (countmath1)\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4_.28answer_choices.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(answer_choices)\">Solution 4 (answer choices)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (answer choices)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We see <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/0/aa0f1fe0cefad366051e16c1870b20eb11df9656.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=12\\cdot\\frac{9\\cdot 10\\cdot 19}{6} -6\\cdot \\frac{9\\cdot 10}{2} + 9 = 9\\cdot (12\\cdot\\frac{10\\cdot 19}{6} -6\\cdot \\frac{10}{2} + 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"491\" height=\"38\" /> which is clearly a multiple of 9. The only answer choice which is a multiple of 9 is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/b/8eb68dfc6d1ebe3ac989d816cbf14c612c101f3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D) } 3159}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"85\" height=\"30\" /> ~Ilaggo2432\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_5_.28Bash.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5_(Bash)\">Solution 5 (Bash)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5 (Bash)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/a/16af6fc8ef32f11046f575640bf5cb8f36e15d68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^3 - 1^3 + 4^3 - 3^3 + 6^3 - 5^3 + \\dots + 18^3 - 17^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"351\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/b/ebb98d0035ea3dfd7b50d80a8813a7ba66a3b0f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=8-1+64-27+216-125+512-343+1000-729+1728-1331+2744-2197+4096-3375+5832-4913$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"917\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/8/9b89613869bbdd8a856d7ebafd0ff7cd261ad7ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= \\boxed{\\textbf{(D) } 3159}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"105\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6\">Solution 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Reduce all terms mod 9. This yields:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/a/16af6fc8ef32f11046f575640bf5cb8f36e15d68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^3 - 1^3 + 4^3 - 3^3 + 6^3 - 5^3 + \\dots + 18^3 - 17^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"351\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/0/2702498146ab35014a1cff98da468f4f23ac6959.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\equiv -1 - 1 + 1 - 0 + 0 - -1 + -1 - 1 + 1 - 0 + 0 - -1 + -1 - 1 + 1 - 0 +0 - -1 (\\mod 9)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"724\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/7/4b7febd14efb9b309dedb66e2eed603c27756dee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\equiv 0 (\\mod 9)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"106\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>The only answer choice which is also ≡0 mod 9 is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/8/9b89613869bbdd8a856d7ebafd0ff7cd261ad7ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= \\boxed{\\textbf{(D) } 3159}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"105\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_7\">Solution 7</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 7\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/9/e49ad701c83e19895ff2047691fe87a891bad13b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^3 - y^3 = (x-y)(x^2 + xy + y^2)\\]\" width=\"249\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Notice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/7/3f79c3676b62fb47243e0d357c87115b6f3395e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"13\" /> is an inverse variation upon <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/4/b6400c6fe3f1ed70e5afd387a9686cdc3fa09531.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"27\" height=\"11\" /> so all values <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/d/cad26f6edad04ace812c8f5be7deeb5aa85a182f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1(2), 3(4), 5(6), \\dots, 17(18)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"206\" height=\"20\" /> form a quadratic where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/9/4b9b6803f8cb4b569bdf7c46cc76badd2b1510f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 1,2,3, \\dots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"112\" height=\"17\" /> gives outputs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/b/07bfa032f4c0716af35d3cfe24179559ceca9ac8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = 2, 12, 30, \\dots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"130\" height=\"17\" />. Through principle of finite differences for the quadratic of the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/d/71d13ac0e00358ad3fa8b0d6db3217b8a10cc7d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ax^2+bx+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"98\" height=\"16\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/c/b8c8bd20535f225b6d9b2b2f54b120f5a967f1d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 2F_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"64\" height=\"17\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/d/e2df9f6e3dec58d5d04c5ac6f07d69f427df8923.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" /> is the second finite difference. It follows <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/c/c6cddef416d8db9e5403348988519606a0a4976d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F_2 = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"17\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f98b3f405113241659d8c8db2ea3480346db4d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />. Solving, we have \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/c/45c3e5eceae6ce045557f9e4f624e5a45da6bc3e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4+b+c = 2\\]\" width=\"101\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/7/037bd4c9f21e07a07ce9f3535215c5d61382a404.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[16+2b+c = 12\\]\" width=\"127\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/5/c9562aa1da7fb31d6215d8dc988562c70a268dfb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b = -2, c = 0\\]\" width=\"103\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>So the quadratic <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/6/0c6931a7076457bb2197e5789c21c8fe46db4e87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x^2 - 2x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"70\" height=\"18\" /> represents the requested values of the inverse variation.\n</p><p>Otherwise, we wish to find\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/2/492d9973a69eb5cdaed9719664af7cdc0191d9cf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{k=0}^{18} k^2 + \\sum_{k=0}^{9} 4k^2 - 2k\\]\" width=\"164\" height=\"51\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/1/541c55ac7068599bf5ffd56d0955bcf9d6ce629f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{18 \\cdot 19 \\cdot 37}{6} + 4\\sum_{k=0}^{9} k^2 + (-2\\sum_{k=0}^{9} k)\\]\" width=\"263\" height=\"51\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/9/7292f1a0f446392f260f63e7dc558d52eed11fea.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2109 + 4 \\cdot 285 - 90\\]\" width=\"147\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/7/8573b1862114187053d5106889d68082e7850b56.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\boxed{3159}\\]\" width=\"48\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>by Power Solve\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/YXIH3UbLqK8?si=RZhSDIKjRNLrgVS5&amp;t=1552\">https://youtu.be/YXIH3UbLqK8?si=RZhSDIKjRNLrgVS5&amp;t=1552</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/33Tz-bfKzmw\">https://youtu.be/33Tz-bfKzmw</a>\n<i> ~Education, the Study of Everything </i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/_eoPL5H8b0k\">https://youtu.be/_eoPL5H8b0k</a>\n</p><p>~Steven Chen (Professor Chen Education Palace, www.professorchenedu.com)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=14\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A\" title=\"2023 AMC 12A\">2023 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2023 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2023 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?ti